["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.285｜从一颗荔枝到一个餐馆：四部影视剧里的中国｜主播：施展 mission impossible\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-cn27f438-北方草原南下不是野蛮赢文明-是有组织赢无组织/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>北方草原南下不是野蛮赢文明，是有组织赢无组织</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">草原武力几百年打不过中原，真正让它取得碾压优势的，是中原官僚系统先把自己耗成了一盘散沙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史周期律</span><span class=\"tag\">官僚系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1363: A Cauldron of Bats Anthropocene Bayesian geospatial logistic regression virus-interacting proteins (VIPs) haplotype-resolved genome assembly PKR (protein kinase R) antagonistic/agonistic pleiotropy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-twiv-离最近诊所每多开一小时车-疫情被发现的概率就降32/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>离最近诊所每多开一小时车，疫情被发现的概率就降32%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">横跨58,319起疫情、169个国家的分析发现，到最近诊所的车程每增加一小时，疫情被发现并控制的概率就下降32%,比任何单一生态因素的影响都更稳定重复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人畜共患病</span><span class=\"tag\">疫情监测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Prehistoric Penguins Zealandia Waimanu pelagornithids Gastornis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-ancients-企鹅比鲸鱼更早称霸南大洋-曾有大猩猩那么大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a4aceaa18f618b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>企鹅比鲸鱼更早称霸南大洋，曾有大猩猩那么大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小行星灭绝恐龙后，企鹅抢在鲸鱼和鲨鱼之前登上南大洋食物链顶端，称霸约一千万年后才退位，变成今天这种讨喜的小个子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">企鹅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"One Brain, Any Body: Google DeepMind&#x27;s Keerthana on Gemini Robotics 2, Cross-Embodiment &amp; Humanoids VLA (vision-language-action model) cross-embodiment in-context learning / video prompting whole-body control UMI (Universal Manipulation Interface) e-stop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-cogrev-机器人大脑仍是-gpt-2-换个身体-同一套模型就不会干活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d4ae49bc11b3d1d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>机器人大脑仍是 GPT-2:换个身体，同一套模型就不会干活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepMind机器人负责人说，机器人至今还没有GPT-3时刻，不是因为听不懂指令，而是同一套策略换一个机身就可能完全失灵，跟GPT在任何电脑上表现一致完全不同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Charles Colchester jugglery billet prestidigitator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-stuffmissed-灵媒讹诈林肯夫人未遂-法庭最终只肯判他是-变戏法的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>灵媒讹诈林肯夫人未遂，法庭最终只肯判他是「变戏法的」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法庭开庭前就言明：这场审判不是要证明灵媒真假，只是要确认柯尔切斯特有没有未经许可卖戏法逃税——这招后来让整个灵媒圈都紧张了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灵媒骗局</span><span class=\"tag\">林肯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Galen Druke on the Midterms generic ballot wins above replacement blue dog Democrat DSA dummander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-goodfight-选民讨厌民主党-不是因为它太左-而是因为它输了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>选民讨厌民主党，不是因为它太左，而是因为它输了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民主党支持率已经低到和特朗普打平，但民调里说它「不够左」的选民只有个位数——真正的愤怒来自输给了特朗普，以及中间选民觉得这个党不在为普通人说话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span><span class=\"tag\">参议院</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beyond the God Model | Alex Atallah &amp; Amjad Masad neurodiversity decision model fusion model sandbagging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-a16z-大模型公司把全球gdp当成自己的潜在市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>大模型公司把全球GDP当成自己的潜在市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型实验室谈融资时对标的是整个世界GDP而非同行，这正是企业要自建AI能力、不把核心业务全押给一家模型公司的根本原因——Figma和Harvey是先例。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多模型路由</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI战略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20VC: The Future of Datacentres: What You Need to Know | Why Everyone Gets GPU Depreciation and AI&#x27;s Energy Costs Wrong | Who Really Makes Money From AI &amp; Why Most Moats Don&#x27;t Exist with Chase Lochmiller KV cache take or pay idiot index RDMA fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-twentyvc-数据中心推高电价是误解-数据显示周边电价反而下降/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7afaaa395482e96d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>数据中心推高电价是误解：数据显示周边电价反而下降</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Crusoe创始人用数据反驳：数据中心建设会催生新发电产能，把更多兆瓦摊薄在同一套输配电网络上，社区电价因此下降而非上涨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Relational Psychology (BONDING VIA LAUGHING) with Sara Algoe and Laura Kurtz benign violation hypothesis inclusion of other in the self Golden Fleece Award\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-ologies-决定关系好坏的不是笑话好不好笑-而是你们有没有一起笑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>决定关系好坏的不是笑话好不好笑，而是你们有没有一起笑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现：让陌生人同步大笑的信号，比内容是否好笑本身更能预测两人会不会愿意继续交往，哪怕全程没有交谈，也能起效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">关系心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">笑声与亲密感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 500c Troels Engberg-Pedersen on St Paul and the Stoics paronesis adiaphora pneuma akrasia politeuma eudaimonia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-hopwag-保罗说的-灵-是斯多葛式的物质-不是柏拉图式的虚无/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>保罗说的「灵」是斯多葛式的物质，不是柏拉图式的虚无</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">保罗本人从未区分物质世界与非物质的「灵」，这个二分是基督教后来被柏拉图主义接管之后才强加上去的，在保罗和斯多葛哲学里「灵」都是实在的物质。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期基督教</span><span class=\"tag\">斯多葛主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1362: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin TORCH infections MTCT germinal centers reactogenicity ACIP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-twiv-卫生部长说ai比医生更懂疫苗-其实是他问错了问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>卫生部长说AI比医生更懂疫苗，其实是他问错了问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">肯尼迪在MAHA峰会上说AI给的意见比全美任何医生都靠谱、能让人摆脱「医疗暴政」；格里芬反驳：AI自己都承认常出错、劝人别靠它找答案，问题出在提问方式而非信源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside The Startup Building Uncensored AI (Abliteration AI) | EP 2345 Abliteration Inversion of control DeepSeek\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-twist-连红队测试自己系统都被ai公司拒绝-催生了去审查模型生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/167cf82c4ff850f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>连红队测试自己系统都被AI公司拒绝，催生了去审查模型生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它把「要不要拒绝执行」的判断权交还给客户自己设定，这解释了为什么连财富500强的CISO都愿意找一家公开标榜「去审查」的模型供应商做红队测试。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trump&#x27;s Super Intelligence Summit, AI Safety Accord, GDP Beats, Midterm Predictions White House Accord on Superintelligence D&amp;O policy K-shaped recovery Polymarket Atlanta Fed GDPNow\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-allin-ai监管下一步不是管模型-而是像配给电力一样配给算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/273ef7fb4c1e777b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>AI监管下一步不是管模型，而是像配给电力一样配给算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弗里德伯格认为，模型每11天就迭代一代，根本管不住；真正能卡脖子的是GPU和服务器数量，政府迟早要出手分配算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力配给</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"509 – Court Costs Constitutio Domus Regis Exchequer crown-wearing ceremony plowshare\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-britishhist-英格兰改收现金税不是体恤农民-而是亨利要打仗方便/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>英格兰改收现金税不是体恤农民，而是亨利要打仗方便</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王室财务官菲茨尼尔说亨利把实物税换成货币税是体恤农民疾苦，但现金更轻便、不会腐坏，还能直接跨海雇佣雇佣兵打仗——这才是亨利真正想要的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪英格兰</span><span class=\"tag\">王室财政</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Using Decision Science in Investing: Masters in Business with Omar Aguilar Bayesian statistics BIAgnostics broker window momentum trade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-mastersinbiz-私募信贷的恐慌不是信用问题-根源是流动性被当成了收益/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>私募信贷的恐慌不是信用问题，根源是流动性被当成了收益</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你的钱没有违约，只是被锁住了几个季度；把私募信贷的流动性溢价误读成信用风险，是这轮恐慌的真正源头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为金融</span><span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Reintegration With the Default World 351 exchange heartbeat trade narrow banking substance over form X-risk\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-moneystuff-银行靠你懒得搬钱赚钱-ai-agent要把这招拆穿了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>银行靠你懒得搬钱赚钱，AI agent要把这招拆穿了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多银行产品定价假设储户不会频繁搬钱；一旦AI agent替你盯盘、自动把闲钱转去收益更高的地方，这类生意的定价逻辑会跟着松动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">税务筹划</span><span class=\"tag\">ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"19 Astra and &#x27;Hugging Face&#x27; details that reveal what&#x27;s coming next | Rob Wiblin chain of thought recurrent depth swarm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-eightythousand-新模型学会少写思考过程-监控ai的最后防线正在失效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09f40d134028b0ce-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">20:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>新模型学会少写思考过程，监控AI的最后防线正在失效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI自己的测试显示，新模型Astra能不写推理就解开人类需三十分钟的数学题——意味着读它的思维文字，已经看不出它真正在想什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">思维链监控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"A 4-Track Mind ragtime\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-radiolab-他能在脑子里同时播放四首交响乐-专业指挥连两首都做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fb3312f6fc86942a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">21:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>他能在脑子里同时播放四首交响乐，专业指挥连两首都做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神经科学家用fMRI扫描验证：职业指挥同时想两首乐曲就彻底卡壳，这位拉格泰姆钢琴师却能精确报出四首交响乐此刻各自播放到哪一个音符。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">音乐认知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Lager, Ale, Emo Girl ale lager animal magnetism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-stuffmissed-靠行善出名的历史人物-日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>靠行善出名的历史人物，日记原稿里满是婚姻抱怨与酗酒痕迹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传记作者核对原始日记后发现，她的女儿们在整理回忆录时抹去了对婚姻的犹豫、与婆家的摩擦，以及借酒精缓解焦虑的痕迹。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史播客</span><span class=\"tag\">啤酒酿造史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Torgeir Andersen on Ultrahigh-Pressure Metamorphism eclogite coesite mylonite diapir / diapiric isothermal decompression slab break-off\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-geologybites-大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里-靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ea2e6d37daecaa7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">27:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>大陆地壳能沉入地幔100公里，靠下方板片断裂才重新浮起</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">挪威西部的花岗质地壳本该上浮，却被下方正在俯冲的大洋板片当作锚拖入地幔深处；板片断裂后浮力反转，地壳才沿原路径折返地表。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地质学</span><span class=\"tag\">变质岩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Agents Can Beat the Incumbents system of record RFQ should-cost modeling direct procurement principal agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-a16z-系统记录里只有价格结果-真正的采购战争藏在系统之外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>系统记录里只有价格结果，真正的采购战争藏在系统之外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">采购价格数字背后，是几十场会议、几百封邮件和上千个供应商——AI原生公司的优势，是把这整段看不见的工作接管下来，而不只是记录结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"689. Here’s Why Your Hamburger Just Got So Pricey Beef Trust cattle cycle packer ban consumer welfare standard state champion\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-freakonomics-牛肉越缺-解法却是让短缺先变得更严重/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>牛肉越缺，解法却是让短缺先变得更严重</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国碎牛肉价格创纪录，根源是牛周期的死结：要缓解牛荒，牧场主得先把母牛留着不卖不杀，让眼下的短缺先变得更严重，才能换来几年后牛群恢复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">农业</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frontier Chips for Frontier AI Labs, with Walter Goodwin, Founder/CEO of Fractile HBM ASIC house GDS2 DRC/LVS clean MFU RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-nopriors-自研芯片是场豪赌-架构一变-九个月内就可能被对手甩开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/56bb382c6f1d7790-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>自研芯片是场豪赌：架构一变，九个月内就可能被对手甩开</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一旦对手摸到只在自家芯片上生效的新架构，押注自研芯片的实验室可能在几个月内就被清出赛场——这正是前沿玩家不敢把身家全压在一款专属芯片上的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">内存带宽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Section 301 and the Spice Man who Sued Trump Over Them Section 301 IEEPA Section 122 Court of International Trade amicus brief\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-02-chinatalk-被判违法的关税-换个法律条文就原样续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55c50eef1cdf01bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1002</span></div>\n<h2>被判违法的关税，换个法律条文就原样续命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国贸易代表办公室援引《贸易法》301条，对占美国贸易额99%的60个经济体加征10%或12.5%关税，税率安排与去年被最高法判违法的关税几乎相同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">关税</span><span class=\"tag\">贸易政策</span>\n</div></div></a>"]